# Settings for npm run content:import. Copy to .env.import, which is git ignored.
#
# No key goes in this file. The import runs through the Supabase CLI login, like
# npm run seed:dev (D-31, D-34), so the service role key is never saved on this
# shared computer.
#
# Importing to atlas-dev needs nothing here: the import checks that .env and the
# CLI link both point at atlas-dev, and refuses anything else.
#
# ATLAS_PROD_REF is used only with --prod, in session S41, and only together with
# the typed confirmation "IMPORT TO PROD". It is the 20-letter project ref of
# atlas-prod from the Supabase dashboard. Leave it empty until S41.

ATLAS_PROD_REF=
